cmd-xeno_larva-desc = Adds burrowed larva to the default xeno hive, creating the hive if none exists. Ghosts can then join as larva.
cmd-xeno_larva-help = Usage: xeno_larva <count>
cmd-xeno_larva-invalid-args = Expected one whole number: the larva to add (negative removes).
cmd-xeno_larva-done = Changed burrowed larva by { $count }; the hive now has { $total }.
